    </laneSet>
    <task id="task_contrato-empresarial_Fechar_um_contrato_empresarial" name="Fechar um contrato empresarial">
      <documentation>notation position: https://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL / Task_CloseEnterprise. The id names a node in the filer's own process document, written in that notation, and not an element of this one. No authority publishes that document, so the id resolves by agreement, never by lookup. [assets/sqlc/entries/notation_references.sqlc]</documentation>
